# The pause menu's VR Hands (0.1.8) by the sticks: pause, down to Options, into it, down past VR Options to VR Hands,
# into it; Gun angle stepped up once and down twice (5 down), down to Gun size and stepped down twice (80 percent), down
# to Hand size and stepped up once and down twice (90 percent); then (0.1.10) Items match hand size, Mirror left-hand
# guns and Left gun ammo each switched Off, HUD size stepped down twice (80 percent) and HUD height up once (5 cm up).
# The right hand is gone, so the sticks move the cursor (options.sim's way). The [vr-hand] VR Hands lines say what each
# step set; the run's vr-options.txt keeps gun_angle -5, gun_size 80, hand_size 90, follow_hands 0, mirror_guns 0,
# left_ammo 0, hud_size 80 and hud_height 5.
